ns 75 years, 1951 to 2025, across 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 30% of normal on the middle, and September to October ran 49%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 21% and February to March at 36%, both on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
